{"id":"odnovremenno","lemma":"одновременно","pos":"adv","rank":1170,"glosses":["simultaneously"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8a/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B2%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B2%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Всё случилось одновременно.","en":"Everything happened simultaneously.","words":[{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"to happen","l":"случиться"},null]},{"text":"Мы приехали туда одновременно.","en":"We got there at the same time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/654008","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to arrive, to come","l":"приехать"},{"g":"there"},null]},{"text":"Нельзя делать две вещи одновременно.","en":"You can't do two things at the same time.","words":[{"g":"it is impossible"},{"g":"to make, to do"},{"g":"two","l":"два"},{"g":"thing, object","l":"вещь"},null]},{"text":"Вы должны стрелять одновременно.","en":"You must shoot at the same time.","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null,{"g":"to shoot, to fire"},null]},{"text":"Я не могу делать два дела одновременно.","en":"I can't do two things at once.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to make, to do"},{"g":"two"},{"g":"to put, to place","l":"деть"},null]}]}